@Teledesk.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Login (Admin padrão criado pelo Seed)
POST {{Teledesk.API_HostAddress}}/api/atendentes/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@teledesk.com",
  "senha": "admin123"
}

### Simular Mensagem Recebida no WhatsApp (Número Principal com URA)
POST {{Teledesk.API_HostAddress}}/api/webhook/whatsapp/simular
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumberId": "100000000000000",
  "waId": "5511999998888",
  "nomeCliente": "Maria Souza",
  "texto": "Olá, preciso de atendimento"
}

### Verificação GET do Webhook da Meta
GET {{Teledesk.API_HostAddress}}/api/webhook/whatsapp?hub.mode=subscribe&hub.verify_token=teledesk_verify_token&hub.challenge=123456
